00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.540
[ Applause ]

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:35.460
If I go into the agent
configuration, I can see outputs

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:37.680
from previous nodes
that I can wire up.

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:41.250
I can see a preview of the
