00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:05.100
We can hook that up to
the normalized data node,

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:06.240
and I've done a lot of building,

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:09.210
but I think you guys probably
want to see this run,

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:11.730
so I'm going to give it
a sample invoice as well

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.880
as a webhook payload that
we would normally get

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:19.350
when a customer submitted
an invoice in our portal.

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:20.340
I want to show you a couple

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.440
of different things
that we have in flow.

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:25.050
Most are supported in
Maestro BPMN as well.

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:27.450
Here is our invoice
extraction node.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:30.030
This is referencing
an IXP project,

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:33.810
which means you don't need to
call a separate process in order

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:36.630
to do extraction via
IXP from Maestro.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:38.700
We're routing via a script node.

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:41.250
We're doing native
data fabric lookups.

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.440
We're basically making a payload

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:45.300
and doing some
discrepancy detection,

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:46.020
and then we're passing

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:48.780
to another agent for
dispute analysis.

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:52.560
As you can see, we have that
context grounding index in line,

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:55.770
and we can see every time
that agent is calling it

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.230
to understand its standard
operating procedure.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:01.950
If we go into the trace view,
we can see every single call

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:05.820
that agent is making as well as
all of the inner workings of all

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:09.870
of the platform components
that Flow is referencing here.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:13.230
I'll close this down, and
as this agent finishes up,

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:16.260
you'll see that it routed
to an approval task.

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:19.140
